DDRNet23-Slim, semantic segmentation of street scenes (Cityscapes classes)

Files in this folder:
  files/ddrnet23_slim.onnx and files/ddrnet23_slim.data are the w8a8 ONNX
  export published by Qualcomm AI Hub Models, release v0.63.0
  (https://huggingface.co/qualcomm/DDRNet23-Slim, licensed MIT on that page,
  whose LICENSE file reads: "The license of the original trained model can be
  found at https://github.com/chenjun2hao/DDRNet.pytorch/blob/main/LICENSE.").
  The weights are the DDRNet-23-slim Cityscapes weights of the original
  authors (https://github.com/ydhongHIT/DDRNet, MIT).

The model was trained on Cityscapes (https://www.cityscapes-dataset.com/).
Its terms state: "It is permissible to distribute derivative works in as far
as they are abstract representations of this dataset (such as models trained
on it or additional annotations that do not directly include any of our data)".
Cite Cityscapes (Cordts et al., CVPR 2016) and DDRNet (Hong et al., 2021,
"Deep Dual-resolution Networks for Real-time and Accurate Semantic
Segmentation of Road Scenes") when you publish results made with it.

